# Cloudflare Pages rules (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
# A player's shared build, probuilds.club/b/<id>, is one static page that reads the id from the address (D-99 (2)).
# 200 rewrites: the address stays /b/<id>; scripts/serve-out.mjs applies the same rule locally.
/b/*  /b  200
# Request a face moved into Submit as its second tab (D-121 (5)).
/faces/request  /submit/request  301
/faces/request/  /submit/request  301
